# Linka time-partition maintenance (ADR 0006).
#
# Install on EXACTLY ONE scheduling context (a dedicated cron host, or one
# Kubernetes CronJob per line) - never per app replica. All times are UTC;
# set the crontab's timezone accordingly (e.g. CRON_TZ=UTC).
#
# scripts/partition_maintenance.sh loads the environment (DATABASE_URL, ...)
# and dispatches to scripts.partition_maintenance. Adjust APP_DIR / the env
# file path in that wrapper for your deployment.
#
# Alerting (wire in your platform):
#   - `ensure` exits non-zero            -> P1 page
#   - `report` shows rows in a DEFAULT   -> page (a write missed its partition)
#   - `report` shows < 2 future messages partitions -> page

CRON_TZ=UTC

# Pre-create dated partitions out to the buffer horizon. Runs first.
10 0 * * *   /opt/linka/scripts/partition_maintenance.sh ensure

# Drop message_receipt_log partitions past RECEIPT_LOG_RETENTION_DAYS.
30 0 * * *   /opt/linka/scripts/partition_maintenance.sh prune-receipts

# Freeze messages partitions older than MESSAGE_PARTITION_COLD_AFTER_MONTHS.
0 1 * * 0    /opt/linka/scripts/partition_maintenance.sh cold

# Emit partition fill / DEFAULT state for monitoring + alerting.
*/15 * * * * /opt/linka/scripts/partition_maintenance.sh report
